		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 9 · 2 Actions.</strong></p><p>Cast <strong>Conjure Illusion</strong> at tier 9 for free. When the duration ends, the current illusion becomes non-magical matter and remains until destroyed. The following rules apply:</p><ul><li>Living creatures cannot be created this way.</li><li>Objects that leave the area immediately dissolve into magical ether.</li><li>Living creatures already in the area are shunted to the closest unoccupied space if an illusion would trap them entirely or cross their space.</li></ul><p>Once you cast this spell, you must Safe Rest for 1 week before using it again.</p>",
